        The engine has TWO trigger paths:
        1) live ball-velocity / impact prediction
        2) enemy animation prediction

        Important exact recovered constants:
        - global broad horizontal/vertical limit: 200 / 200
        - ball drag for impact sim: 0.9737 every 0.05s
        - animation-tracking expiry: 5s
        - global defense throttle: 2s
        - "moving toward us" cone: 45 degrees
        - direct-at-us velocity dot threshold: 0.85
        - direct-at-us predicted horizontal threshold: 12 studs
        - non-toward ball is rejected if farther than 15 studs
        ]]

        local function createAutoDefensive(ctx)
            local Players = assert(ctx.players, "players required")
            local RunService = assert(ctx.runService, "runService required")
